Patch for sccache v0.18.0 (mozilla/sccache 01c35e69b97f516c2ebfbdb418b5cd6277bde280) so it
works with headstart. In client-side mode (SCCACHE_CLIENT_SIDE=1) with SCCACHE_STREAM_STDERR=1,
it passes rustc's stderr through as it arrives, so Cargo sees early-metadata notifications; and
with -Zearly-metadata it hashes dependencies' early metadata and caches each crate's own.

